# Int8 wake-word op profile for build_idf_component.sh: one root op per line.
#
# Derived from an int8 (Cadence-backend PTQ) export of a streaming
# wake-word model: the op list is `gen_oplist` output on the quantized
# .pte. The cadence:: ops run on the Cadence backend's generic
# (portable) kernel implementations from backends/cadence/generic. The
# Cadence edge lowering always skips dim_order, so dim_order copy
# spellings are not needed here. aten::_to_copy.out is included
# defensively for export-flag variation.
aten::_softmax.out
aten::_to_copy.out
aten::cat.out
aten::copy_
aten::permute_copy.out
aten::slice_copy.Tensor_out
aten::squeeze_copy.dim_out
aten::transpose_copy.int_out
cadence::dequantize_per_tensor.out
cadence::quantize_per_tensor.out
cadence::quantized_conv2d_nhwc.per_tensor_out
cadence::quantized_fully_connected.per_tensor_out
cadence::quantized_relu.per_tensor_out
